---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="Background, education, and what I'm working on.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="intro prose">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        I'm Siva Balan Saravanan, a software engineer from India, now in New York for my
        master's at NYU Courant.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of my industry work has been backend engineering on lending software: Node.js
        services, MongoDB performance, caching, event-driven systems, and the production support
        that comes with real clients. At NYU I've been going deeper into how AI systems work
        underneath, from training small language models to writing attention kernels for H100s,
        and building applications on top of LLMs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm looking for full-time roles starting after May 2027 in software engineering,
        applied AI, and forward deployed engineering.
      </p>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>MS in Computer Science</strong>, NYU Courant, Sep 2025 – May 2027. GPA 3.67.<br />
        <span class="muted">Coursework: Building LLM Reasoners, GPU Programming and Architecture, Machine Learning, Realtime Big Data Analytics, Big Data Application Development, Technologies for Finance, Fundamental Algorithms, Operating Systems, Programming Languages.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering</strong>, Amrita School of Engineering, 2018 – 2022. GPA 8.6/10.
      </p>

      <h2>Competitive programming</h2>
      <p>
        I represented NYU at the ICPC North America Greater New York Regional in October 2025.
        I'm rated 4 stars on CodeChef (max 1801) and practice regularly on Codeforces and LeetCode.
      </p>

      <h2>Papers I've read</h2>
      <p>I read systems papers to understand the designs behind the tools I use. A few of them:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>MapReduce</li>
        <li>HDFS</li>
        <li>Bigtable</li>
        <li>ZooKeeper</li>
        <li>Kafka</li>
        <li>Spark (resilient distributed datasets)</li>
        <li>Apache Flink</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        The best way to reach me is email at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        I'm also on <a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> and <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
